1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,947
A million bucks, two briefcases left. Stay or switch? 'Cause your gut's wrong.

2
00:00:04,247 --> 00:00:06,691
Three cases, one has the cash, and you picked one.

3
00:00:06,941 --> 00:00:10,123
The host knows where the cash is, and always opens an empty one.

4
00:00:10,373 --> 00:00:12,494
Tap the heart if you're thinking fifty-fifty.

5
00:00:13,344 --> 00:00:15,599
Nah, your pick was one in three, and still is.

6
00:00:15,849 --> 00:00:17,795
Send this to the friend who'll argue.

7
00:00:18,045 --> 00:00:20,737
The other— the case he skipped? That one's two in three.

8
00:00:21,437 --> 00:00:23,990
Don't buy it? Follow, this page settles arguments.

9
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:28,484
The real game-show host tried it himself, and guess what won? Switching.

10
00:00:29,084 --> 00:00:30,536
So… stay or switch?
